OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,6,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,7,Fthe hills. Some brighter spells, the
OL,8,Fbest of these through Dumfries and
OL,9,FGalloway. Breezy around the Solway
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry for most with the cloud
OL,13,Fthinning and breaking at times.
OL,14,FHowever, a little patchy rain could
OL,15,Fpush into Dumfries and Galloway later
OL,16,Fin the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
