OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMainly dry and cloudy or
OL,6,Fbright, the best of any sunshine
OL,7,Facross Dumfries and Galloway. Some
OL,8,Fheavy showers possible here in the
OL,9,Fevening as well as the Borders.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FMostly cloudy with rain or showers at
OL,13,Ftimes, the rain perhaps heavy and
OL,14,Fthundery. Some drier and brighter
OL,15,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
